@WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5181

### Create a wallet
POST {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "initialBalance": 1000
}

### List all wallets
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Wallets
Accept: application/json

### Get one wallet
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Wallets/1
Accept: application/json

### Deposit
POST {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Wallets/1/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 250 }

### Withdraw
POST {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Wallets/1/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### Query: high-value wallets
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/WalletQueries/high-value?minBalance=1000

### Query: total system liquidity
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/WalletQueries/liquidity

### Query: most active wallets
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/WalletQueries/most-active?topCount=5

### Query: top transactions
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/WalletQueries/top-transactions?topCount=5

### Query: dormant wallets
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/WalletQueries/dormant

### Query: cash flow per wallet
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/WalletQueries/cash-flow

### Query: transactions in a date range
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/WalletQueries/1/transactions-range?startDate=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z

### Query: recent high-balance wallets
GET {{WalletManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/WalletQueries/recent-high-balance?minBalance=500&days=30